From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 13:00:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 15/16] TEMP-DOORS-2: heater doors SnHeaterDoor / SnHeaterDoor2
 also disabled at boot -- TEMPORARY, revert before production
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 20260926: the machine raised MES1625 (SnHeaterDoor) after TEMP-DOORS 0b3344b, because InitialHeaterDoor() (called at the end
of InitialSafeDoor) enables SnHeaterDoor and SnHeaterDoor2 (MES1626) and their IO_Table rows are still old MotionNet addresses with
no card on this machine. Same way as TEMP-DOORS (the user's comment "//JerryYang 20260926 安全門還沒好, 暫時MARK掉"): Enable=false,
placed right AFTER the InitialHeaterDoor() call (outside the un-braced if) so it wins.
REVERT THIS COMMIT together with 0b3344b before the "opening a door stops the machine" verification and before production.
Build: build_integ_ship_x86 wb_serve exit 0; pe_truncation 178 complete. Not run on the machine yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 cinitial.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/cinitial.cpp b/cinitial.cpp
index 04681cb..92608fe 100644
--- a/cinitial.cpp
+++ b/cinitial.cpp
@@ -3136,6 +3136,9 @@ void InitialSafeDoor()
     if(MachineTypeChoice!=Type_HT7080)                                          //Nickliu 20230313 add HT70XX No Heater Door
         InitialHeaterDoor();
 
+    Sen[SnHeaterDoor].Enable=false;     //JerryYang 20260926 安全門還沒好, 暫時MARK掉  //AI(W906-TEMP-DOORS) 20260926: EastSun 要求暖氣門也暫時關（MES1625）；InitialHeaterDoor() 在上面把它打開，所以放在它之後
+    Sen[SnHeaterDoor2].Enable=false;    //JerryYang 20260926 安全門還沒好, 暫時MARK掉  //AI(W906-TEMP-DOORS) 20260926: 同上（MES1626）；上線前要還原
+
     if(CUSTOMER_CODE==CC_KYEC_LEE)                                              //Ifor 20230608 add:KYEC 要求[P35] Tray Arm home safe pos強制反灰由DB選擇開/關
     {
         IniConfig.bP35TrayArm=Sen[SnTrayArmSafePos].Enable;
